                "textId": "translation-group:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a",
                "paragraphId": "zh-reading-a-p8",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 71,
                "quote": "你可以跟随我们的讲解员，参加“年度野生动物摄影师”展览的特别导览（上午 9:00 至 9:45 开放），发现那些没有写进说明文字的故事和细节。"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "discourseStructure": {
        "summary": "先介绍展览主题和三条看点，点明照片提醒人们关注自然；再补充声景、影片等展示形式和特别导览；最后列出展期、地址以及高峰、非高峰两档票价。",
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:1",
            "summary": "摄影展迎来第六十年，继续讲述大自然的故事。",
            "function": "开篇点出展览及其主题。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:2",
            "summary": "展览带观众领略不同环境和栖居其中的野生动物。",
            "function": "概括展览带给观众的体验。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:3",
            "summary": "看点之一：亲眼看到人类活动正如何影响自然。",
            "function": "列举展览看点。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:4",
            "summary": "看点之二：欣赏从掠食者捕猎到精美构图的影像。",
            "function": "列举展览看点。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:5",
            "summary": "看点之三：见证生存、脆弱与生命平衡的故事。",
            "function": "列举展览看点。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:6",
            "summary": "每张照片都在提醒人们自然世界的奇妙。",
            "function": "点明展览的用意。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:7",
            "summary": "照片之外，还有声景、影片和专家见解，介绍生命之美和保护之道。",
            "function": "补充展览的其他展示形式。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:8",
            "summary": "观众可在上午 9:00 至 9:45 参加特别导览，了解说明文字之外的故事。",
            "function": "介绍导览服务。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:9",
            "summary": "展期为 2024 年 10 月 11 日至 2025 年 6 月 29 日。",
            "function": "交代展期。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:10",
            "summary": "展览地点在伦敦南肯辛顿的东馆画廊。",
            "function": "交代地点。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:11",
            "summary": "高峰时段票价表的标题。",
            "function": "引出高峰票价。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:12",
            "summary": "高峰时段指周末、学校假期和法定假日。",
            "function": "说明高峰票价的适用日期。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:13",
            "summary": "高峰时段成人票 18 英镑。",
            "function": "列出票价。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:14",
            "summary": "高峰时段儿童票 10.95 英镑。",
            "function": "列出票价。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:15",
            "summary": "高峰时段两大一小家庭票 37.50 英镑。",
            "function": "列出票价。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:16",
            "summary": "高峰时段两大两小家庭票 46 英镑。",
            "function": "列出票价。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:17",
            "summary": "高峰时段两大三小家庭票 54.95 英镑。",
            "function": "列出票价。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:18",
            "summary": "非高峰时段票价表的标题。",
            "function": "引出非高峰票价。"
          },
          {
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-anhui-jiangnan10-2025-m1:reading-a:19",
            "summary": "非高峰时段指周一至周五，学校假期和法定假日除外。",
            "function": "说明非高峰票价的适用日期。"
          },
